00:02:59.353 --> 00:03:00.186
(audience laughs)

00:03:00.186 --> 00:03:01.193
Sorry

00:03:01.193 --> 00:03:03.294
- Now who's, then we come to pubic hair.

00:03:03.294 --> 00:03:05.580
