is true, that is true.

00:03:39.198 --> 00:03:40.645
- It's all, it's all gone.

00:03:40.645 --> 00:03:42.600
- It's all gone.

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:46.080
And so, basically he's creating
a new sort of mob world.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.850
It's a little fish outta water.

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:49.830
It's, he's amazing in the show.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.750
